> Your AI assistant can now use `MControl` objects with the `variable: '<name>'` definition to hook any graph definition linearly. For instance, generating an `MGraph` where `expr: A*sin(B*x)` accompanied by sliders for `A` and `B` creates an instant wave amplitude/frequency explorable!

## Verification Results

* ✅ State resolves seamlessly without re-rendering unnecessarily
* ✅ Algebra evaluation cleanly handles syntax spacing or equivalent representations (e.g. `2x` and `x*2` correctly pass as `2` is equivalent to `2`)
* ✅ Quizzes correctly lock the `< Next Step >` UI logic
